msgid ""
msgstr ""
"# Matrix Multiplication Example\n"
"\n"
"This example demonstrates how to use the `matmul` function to perform matrix multiplication. The `matmul` function is a core API in the SDK, used to compute the product of two matrices. The following code shows how to create two matrices and multiply them using the `matmul` function.\n"
"\n"
"```cpp\n"
"#include \"matmul.hpp\"\n"
"#include <vector>\n"
"#include <iostream>\n"
"\n"
"int main() {\n"
"    // Define two matrices\n"
"    std::vector<std::vector<float>> A = {\n"
"        {1.0f, 2.0f, 3.0f},\n"
"        {4.0f, 5.0f, 6.0f}\n"
"    };\n"
"    std::vector<std::vector<float>> B = {\n"
"        {7.0f, 8.0f},\n"
"        {9.0f, 10.0f},\n"
"        {11.0f, 12.0f}\n"
"    };\n"
"\n"
"    // Call the matmul function to compute the product\n"
"    auto C = matmul(A, B);\n"
"\n"
"    // Output the result\n"
"    std::cout << \"Result of matrix multiplication:\" << std::endl;\n"
"    for (const auto& row : C) {\n"
"        for (const auto& elem : row) {\n"
"            std::cout << elem << \" \";\n"
"        }\n"
"        std::cout << std::endl;\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    return 0;\n"
"}\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"In this example, matrix A is a 2x3 matrix, matrix B is a 3x2 matrix, and the result C is a 2x2 matrix. The `matmul` function automatically handles the dimension matching and computation process.\n"

msgid "矩阵乘法 （Matrix Multiplication）"
msgstr "Matrix Multiplication"

msgid "在本节中，我们展示了使用 Triton 进行矩阵乘法的内核实现。"
msgstr "In this section, we demonstrate a kernel implementation for matrix multiplication using Triton."

msgid "计算内核"
msgstr "Compute kernel."

msgid "以下 Triton 内核实现了一个带偏置项的批量矩阵乘法（Batched Matrix Multiplication with Bias）： 计算公式为："
msgstr "The following Triton kernel implements a batched matrix multiplication with bias: the computation formula is:"

msgid "$$ \\mathrm{output}[b, i, j] = \\sum_{k} x[b, i, k] \\cdot y[k, j] + z[b, i, j] $$"
msgstr "$$ \\mathrm{output}[b, i, j] = \\sum_{k} x[b, i, k] \\cdot y[k, j] + z[b, i, j] $$"

msgid "其中："
msgstr "Where:"

msgid "`x` 的形状为 `(A, B)`"
msgstr "The shape of `x` is `(A, B)`."

msgid "`y` 的形状为 `(B, C)`"
msgstr "The shape of `y` is `(B, C)`."

msgid "`z`（偏置）的形状为 `(A, C)`"
msgstr "The shape of `z` (bias) is `(A, C)`."

msgid "输出 `output` 的形状为 `(A, C)`"
msgstr "The shape of `output` is `(A, C)`."

msgid "该内核假设单个 block 负责整个输出矩阵的计算，适用于小规模矩阵（A、B、C 较小且能被当前程序块完全覆盖）。"
msgstr "This kernel assumes that a single block is responsible for computing the entire output matrix, making it suitable for small-scale matrices (A, B, and C are small and can be fully covered by the current block)."

